{"id": "21", "pred": "Magellan of Virginia hosts weekly Provider Q&A Sessions every Friday from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., which are open to all providers to address their questions and issues. These calls continue until further notice. Magellan administers behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs and partners with members, providers, and stakeholders to elevate the quality and satisfaction in healthcare delivery.", "raw_output": "Magellan of Virginia hosts weekly Provider Q&A Sessions every Friday from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m., which are open to all providers to address their questions and issues. These calls continue until further notice. Magellan administers behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs and partners with members, providers, and stakeholders to elevate the quality and satisfaction in healthcare delivery.", "gt": "Magellan of Virginia is the Behavioral Health Services Administrator for the Virginia Department of Medical Assistance Services. They administer behavioral health services for members enrolled in Virginia’s Medicaid and FAMIS programs. The site is also for providers, offering them resources like weekly Q&A sessions each Friday from 1 p.m. - 2:30 p.m. where they can address their questions and issues. Additionally, they offer continuing education clock hours/credits for e-learning courses, approved by organizations like the American Psychological Association and the Association of Social Work Boards.", "question": "magellan of virginia provider", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 29.922, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [32915, 84786, 315, 12989, 18432, 17059, 22916, 1207, 35021, 30800, 1449, 6602, 504, 220, 16, 281, 744, 13, 311, 220, 17, 25, 18, 15, 281, 744, 2572, 892, 525, 1787, 311, 678, 12565, 311, 2621, 862, 4755, 3