ests enlarging the latch hole in the jamb, tightening the hinges, and moving the strike plate to align with the latch.\n\nIn summary, there is no definitive solution in the provided passages to fix a door that won't lock directly. However, these passages provide general tips and troubleshooting steps that may help identify and resolve related issues such as misaligned door stops or latches. If the problem persists after trying these methods, it may be best to consult a professional locksmith or carpenter.", "question": "how to fix a door that won't lock", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 85.088, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 5046, 264, 6006, 429, 2765, 944, 5296, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 48274, 279, 6006, 323, 1430, 311, 5296, 432, 13, 1416, 432, 2765, 944, 5296, 11, 1787, 279, 6006, 624, 17, 13, 36134, 279, 835, 315, 264, 521, 65294, 1212, 279, 6006, 2936, 389, 279, 43941, 3108, 315, 279, 502, 2969, 323, 81279, 432, 705, 3080, 432, 4041, 20174, 13, 10783, 432, 11, 323, 1083, 4057, 279, 6006, 2936, 389, 1909, 624, 18, 13, 10771, 279, 6006, 2936, 1182, 389, 279, 502, 2969, 11, 6243, 432, 1182, 220, 16, 14, 19, 17122, 504, 1181, 4024, 3728, 13, 5443, 279, 1555, 304, 279, 6177, 11, 51964, 11, 476, 762, 96839, 311, 5285, 432, 10277, 624, 19, 13, 74428, 279, 3108, 323, 1909, 9666, 315, 279, 6006, 2936, 1182, 389, 624, 20, 13, 74346, 268, 279, 75593, 44922, 1156, 624, 21, 13, 2925, 16767, 279, 13169, 11968, 14178, 476, 3271, 279, 13169, 11968, 421, 279, 56926, 3171, 1405, 5285, 448, 279, 14178, 304, 279, 13169, 11968, 624, 22, 13, 25001, 279, 1036, 33115, 29033, 1273, 854, 421, 5786, 44598, 4436, 1405, 9355, 9434, 311, 8253, 1380, 32974, 525, 4362, 382, 6025, 1493, 32974, 11, 279, 6006, 1265, 9311, 323, 5296, 14279, 382, 16141, 25, 48274, 279, 6006, 323, 1430, 311, 5296, 432, 13, 1416, 432, 2765, 944, 5296, 11, 40