{"id": "50", "pred": "The benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis, and effectively cleaning around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access. Additionally, it shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.", "raw_output": "The benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis, and effectively cleaning around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access. Additionally, it shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.", "gt": "A water pick, also known as a Waterpik, is a beneficial tool for oral care. It is designed to shoot a strong stream of water at the gum line to help eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to get rid of with a toothbrush. It can also help maintain overall body health. In comparison to flossing, using a water pick can be easier and leave your mouth feeling cleaner. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. It is especially useful in cleaning around the teeth and gums, removing food from areas that brushing cannot reach.", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 27.48, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 20337, 1661, 20655, 2820, 11, 3072, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 11, 323, 13444, 15826, 2163, 279, 17832, 323, 97654, 553, 17592, 3607, 18730, 504, 5671, 429, 76726, 4157, 2615, 13, 22406,