{"id": "53", "pred": "The benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis, and effectively cleaning around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access. Additionally, it shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.", "raw_output": "The benefits of a water pick include maintaining good oral health, massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis, and effectively cleaning around the teeth and gums by removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access. Additionally, it shoots a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the benefits of using a water pick (also known as a Waterpik) include:\n\n1. Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating germs and plaque.\n2. Being a great oral care tool for removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Being an alternative to flossing and potentially offering similar benefits.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide information on other potential benefits of using a water pick, such as its ability to reach areas between teeth or its effectiveness in reducing plaque buildup.", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 27.461, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 2924, 20337, 1661, 20655, 2820, 11, 3072, 4118, 323, 64692, 8413, 19847, 304, 279, 10780, 311, 7949, 279, 5214, 315, 66093, 344, 19435, 1