{"id": "62", "pred": "This will set the selected browser as the default for opening hyperlinks and web links in Windows 7.", "raw_output": "To set the default web browser in Windows 7, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open the Settings app by either opening the Start menu and clicking the Settings icon or using the keyboard shortcut Windows + I.\n2. Click on the first option titled \"System\" (which includes display, notifications, apps, and power settings).\n3. In the left-pane, click on \"Default apps.\"\n4. On the right-side of the screen, scroll down to locate the \"Web browser\" section.\n5. Click on the current default browser entry (such as Edge or another browser other than Chrome), which will reveal the \"Choose an app\" option.\n6. Select the browser you want to set as default (e.g., Google Chrome) from the list.\n\nThis will set the selected browser as the default for opening hyperlinks and web links in Windows 7.", "gt": "Method 1 of 2 in passage 2 provides the steps to set the default web browser in Windows 7.", "question": "set default browser to windows", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 57.003, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 738, 279, 1638, 3482, 6929, 304, 5515, 220, 22, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 5264, 279, 11296, 906, 553, 2987, 8568, 279, 5145, 5022, 323, 18458, 279, 11296, 4603, 476, 1667, 279, 13625, 37115, 5515, 488, 358, 624, 17, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 1156, 2999, 24849, 330, 2320, 1, 320, 8206, 5646, 3037, 11, 21969, 11, 10500, 11, 323, 2355, 5003, 4292, 18, 13, 758, 279, 2115, 38452, 11, 4205, 389, 330, 3675, 10500, 10040, 19, 13, 1913, 279, 1290, 24067, 315, 279, 4171, 11, 9059, 1495, 311, 24523, 279, 330, 5981, 6929, 1, 3772, 624, 20, 13, 9189, 389, 279, 1482, 1638, 6929, 4343, 320, 20805, 438, 10349, 476, 2441, 6929, 1008, 1091, 17225, 701, 892, 686, 16400, 279, 330, 24051, 458, 906, 1, 2999,