-0.3018, -0.0107, -0.6498, -0.8679, -0.5256, -0.0522, -1.0513, -0.1597, -0.9109, -1.1114, -0.7876, -0.4834, -0.0641, -0.9107, -0.2808, -0.1243, -0.0167, -0.6847, -0.5846, -0.0046, -0.0001, -0.4934, -0.4956, -0.0, -0.0146], "cumulative_logprob": -42.9954, "norm_logp": -0.168, "input_len": 579, "output_tokens": 256, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.27, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 6.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
{"id": "185", "pred": "Based on passage 1 and passage 2, chicken in a crock pot can be cooked on low for 6–8 hours until done. Alternatively, it can be cooked on high for 1 hour followed by low for about 5 hours until done. Passage 3 also supports that cooking chicken breasts on low for 8 hours in a slow cooker will make them tender, and that cooking for 4 hours on high also works fine as long as there is enough moisture. Therefore, the time required to make chicken tender in a crock pot ranges from 4 hours on high to 8 hours on low, depending on the setting used.", "raw_output": "Based on passage 1 and passage 2, chicken in a crock pot can be cooked on low for 6–8 hours until done. Alternatively, it can be cooked on high for 1 hour followed by low for about 5 hours until done. Passage 3 also supports that cooking chicken breasts on low for 8 hours in a slow cooker will make them tender, and that cooking for 4 hours on high also works fine as long as there is enough moisture. Therefore, the time required to make chicken tender in a crock pot ranges from 4 hours on high to 8 hours on low, depending on the setting used.", "gt": "To make chicken tender in a crock pot, you can cook it on low for 6 - 8 hours or until done. Alternatively, you can cook it on high for 1 hour, then on low for about 5 hours or until done. Another option is cooking it for 4 hours on high.", "question": "how long does it take to make chicken tender in crock pot", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 44.241, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 21085, 220, 16, 323, 21085, 220, 17, 11, 16158, 304, 264, 14093, 377, 3338, 646, 387, 29105, 389, 3347, 369, 220, 21, 4142, 23, 4115, 3080, 2814, 13, 38478, 11, 432, 646, 387, 29105, 389, 1550, 369, 220, 16, 6460, 8110, 553, 3347, 369, 911, 220, 20, 4115, 3080, 2814, 13, 98475, 220, 18, 1083, 11554, 429, 17233, 1