{"id": "260", "pred": "1. Helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals.\n4. Enabling full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, as it locks with MSM (sulfur).\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis by managing water pressure imbalances inside cells.", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals.\n4. Enabling full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, as it locks with MSM (sulfur).\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis by managing water pressure imbalances inside cells.", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 36.604, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2688, 11083, 304, 279, 43125, 315, 36393, 1741, 438, 45092, 323, 3