{"id": "264", "pred": "1. Helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals.\n4. Enabling full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, as it locks with MSM (sulfur).\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis by managing water pressure imbalances inside cells.", "raw_output": "The benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n1. Helping get oxygen into the blood more efficiently with the same amount of work.\n2. Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable.\n3. Assisting in the absorption of nutrients such as vitamins and minerals.\n4. Enabling full utilization of Co-enzyme Q10, as it locks with MSM (sulfur).\n5. Relieving muscular aches and pains.\n6. Reducing inflammation caused by injury or inflammatory diseases like arthritis by managing water pressure imbalances inside cells.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of MSM powder:\n\n1. Increases energy levels by making cell walls more permeable and allowing nutrients to be absorbed more efficiently.\n2. Helps reduce inflammation and swelling in muscles and joints.\n3. Relieves muscular aches and pains.\n4. Enhances the absorption of vitamins and minerals, including Co-enzyme Q10.\n\nNote that the passages do not mention any other specific benefits of MSM powder beyond these points.", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 36.795, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 90701, 633, 23552, 1119, 279, 6543, 803, 29720, 448, 279, 1852, 3311, 315, 975, 624, 17, 13, 73440, 4802, 5866, 553, 3259, 2779, 14285, 803, 54324, 480, 624, 18, 13, 2