{"id": "272", "pred": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings due to hormonal changes, dizziness from dilated blood vessels and dropped blood pressure, bloating, spotting, cramping, and nausea or vomiting. Nausea and vomiting, commonly known as morning sickness, affect around half of all pregnant women and typically start around six weeks after the last period. Some women may also experience emotional changes and weepiness in early pregnancy. A missed period is a well-known indicator, but these other symptoms can also signal early pregnancy.", "raw_output": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings due to hormonal changes, dizziness from dilated blood vessels and dropped blood pressure, bloating, spotting, cramping, and nausea or vomiting. Nausea and vomiting, commonly known as morning sickness, affect around half of all pregnant women and typically start around six weeks after the last period. Some women may also experience emotional changes and weepiness in early pregnancy. A missed period is a well-known indicator, but these other symptoms can also signal early pregnancy.", "gt": "The earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy include mood swings, dizziness, bloating, spotting, cramping, nausea, and vomiting.", "question": "earliest signs and symptoms of pregnancy", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 35.518, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 29658, 11929, 323, 13495, 315, 19636, 2924, 19671, 56790, 4152, 311, 73118, 4344, 11, 294, 96645, 504, 18840, 657, 6543, 29980, 323, 12226, 6543, 7262, 11, 14211, 1095, 11, 89219, 11, 1560, 30457, 11, 323, 60780, 476, 62471, 13, 451, 3454, 64, 323, 62471, 11, 16626, 3881, 438, 6556, 53850, 11, 7802, 2163, 4279, 315, 678, 20280, 3198, 323, 11136, 1191, 2163, 4743, 5555, 1283, 279, 1537, 4168, 13, 4329, 3198, 1231, 1083, 3139, 14269, 4344, 