{"id": "334", "pred": "To get rid of ticks from dogs, use a pair of tweezers to grasp the head of the tick where it attaches to the skin. Pull on the tick gently and steadily. Avoid yanking quickly to prevent leaving part of the tick’s mouth behind, which could cause an infection. Wear gloves if removing the tick with fingers. Additionally, check inside and behind the dog’s ears and around the eyes, as these are common tick hiding places. For prevention, use regular tick control products recommended by a veterinarian.", "raw_output": "To get rid of ticks from dogs, use a pair of tweezers to grasp the head of the tick where it attaches to the skin. Pull on the tick gently and steadily. Avoid yanking quickly to prevent leaving part of the tick’s mouth behind, which could cause an infection. Wear gloves if removing the tick with fingers. Additionally, check inside and behind the dog’s ears and around the eyes, as these are common tick hiding places. For prevention, use regular tick control products recommended by a veterinarian.", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "question": "how to get rid of ticks from dogs", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 35.586, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 633, 9279, 315, 29957, 504, 12590, 11, 990, 264, 6716, 315, 14545, 10125, 388, 311, 33377, 279, 1968, 315, 279, 9341, 1380, 432, 84503, 311, 279, 6787, 13, 31828, 389, 279, 9341, 29273, 323, 41971, 13, 34006, 379, 32334, 6157, 311, 5358, 9380, 949, 315, 279, 9341, 748, 10780, 4815, 11, 892, 1410, 5240, 458, 18873, 13, 41062, 35416, 421, 17592, 279, 9341, 448, 19225, 13, 22406, 11, 1779, 4766, 323, 4815, 279, 5562, 748, 24230, 323, 2163, 279, 6414, 11, 438, 1493, 525, 4185, 9341, 25037, 7482, 13, 1752, 26248, 11, 990, 5792, 9341, 2524, 3871, 11102, 553, 264, 81240, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0839, -0.0298, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0