{"id": "406", "pred": "An instructional video is available for removing the interior door panel trim on a 2006 Chevy Impala, which covers the process for repairs such as door handles, window regulators, power window motors,", "raw_output": "Based on the provided passages, the instructions specifically apply to the Chevy HHR for removing the rear door panel, detailing steps such as removing screws inside the door pull cup and near the inside door handle, removing a pin on the outer edge, and using a door panel removal tool. However, passage 2 mentions a video applicable to the Chevy Impala model years 06, 07, 08, 09, 10, 11, and 12, which includes removing or replacing the interior door panel trim for repairs like door handles, window regulators, power window motors, and door locks.\n\nWhile the passage does not provide specific instructions for removing the door panel of a 2006 Chevy Impala, it does confirm that such a process is covered in a video for that model. Therefore, the general procedure for removing a door panel in a 2006 Chevy (likely referring to the Impala) is shown in an instructional video, but the exact steps are not detailed in the provided text.\n\nAnswer: An instructional video is available for removing the interior door panel trim on a 2006 Chevy Impala, which covers the process for repairs such as door handles, window regulators, power window motors,", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is the answer to the question:\n\nTo remove the door panel on a 2006 Chevy, you will need to:\n\n1. Remove the two screws located inside the door pull cup.\n2. Remove the screw in the middle of the inside door handle.\n3. Remove the pin that holds the panel in place on the outer edge of the door.\n4. Use a door panel removal tool to pry the door panel off the rear door.\n5. Remove any wiring connections.\n6. Gently pull the panel away from the frame.\n\nAfter removing the screws and clips, you will be able to remove the door panel. It is recommended to watch an instructional video to see the process and locate the parts mentioned.", "question": "2006 chevy remove door panel", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 83.782, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 279, 11221, 11689, 3796, 311, 279, 57298, 472, 17088, 369, 17592, 279, 14639, 6006, 6945, 11, 44193, 7354, 1741, 438, 17592, 44922, 4766, 279, 6006, 6815, 10525, 323, 3143, 279, 4766, 6006, 3705, 11, 17592, 264, 8983, 389, 279, 15955, 6821, 11, 323, 1667, 264, 6006, 6945, 16652, 5392, 13, 4354, 11, 21085, 220, 17, 33845, 264, 2766, 8415, 311, 279, 57298, 14390, 6053, 1614, 1635, 220, 15, 21, 11, 220, 15, 22, 11, 220, 15, 23, 11, 220, 15, 24, 11, 220, 16, 15, 11, 220, 16, 16, 11, 323, 220, 16, 17, 11, 892, 5646, 17592, 476, 24891, 279, 14791, 6006, 6945, 11013, 369, 30186, 1075, 6006, 13469, 11, 3241, 39142, 11, 2355, 3241, 37324, 11, 323, 6006, 31676, 382, 7983, 279, 21085, 1558, 537, 3410, 3151, 11221, 369, 17592, 279, 6006, 6945, 315, 264, 220, 17, 15, 15, 21, 57298, 14390, 6053, 11, 432, 1558, 7683, 429, 1741, 264, 1882, 374, 9761, 304, 264, 2766, 369, 429, 1614, 13, 15277, 11, 279, 4586, 10324, 369, 17592, 264, 6006, 6945, 304, 264, 220, 17, 15, 15, 21, 57298, 320, 14282, 22023, 311, 279, 14390, 6053, 8, 374, 6839, 304, 458, 71245, 2766, 11, 714, 279, 4734, 7354, 525, 537, 11682, 304, 279, 3897, 1467, 382, 16141, 25, 1527, 71245, 2766, 374, 2500, 369, 17592, 279, 14791, 6006, 6945, 11013, 389, 264, 220, 17, 15, 15, 21, 57298, 14390, 6053, 11, 892, 14521, 279, 1882, 369, 30186, 1741, 438, 6006, 13469, 11, 3241, 39142, 11, 2355, 3241, 37324, 11], "logp_list": [-0.2344, -0.0001, -0.4564, -0.4689, -0.0146, -0.0049, -1.2889, -0.4409, -0.753, -0.6978, -0.0, -0.1373, -0.2362, -0.0111, -0.0, -0.4131, -0.0794, -0.031, -0.0001, 0.0, 0.0, -0.28, -0.9945, -0.7093, -0.2024, -0.0, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.2597, -0.0, -