{"id": "435", "pred": "Tip: Knowing the person's middle name can be very helpful to ensure you are identifying the correct individual, especially", "raw_output": "To find someone in France, you can use the following methods as described in the passages:\n\n1. Use a people search website for France to locate relatives by sending an email or letter to the town hall in the city of their birth if you know where they were born.\n\n2. Try the French white pages in English at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. Instead of typing Paris in the City field, enter IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field to search Paris and its suburbs.\n\n3. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr (Pages Blanches), the French version of the white pages:\n   - Enter the last name in the Nom field.\n   - Optionally, enter the first name in Prenom.\n   - Input address information in the Ou section if known; otherwise, leave it blank to search the entire country.\n   - Click Trouver to search for the name. The results will display name, address, and phone number for all matching listings.\n\nAdditionally, posting a missed connection (MC) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...) may also help.\n\nTip: Knowing the person's middle name can be very helpful to ensure you are identifying the correct individual, especially", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use a website for people search in France. Sending an email or letter to the Town Hall in the person's city of birth can also be helpful, especially if you have lost relatives or friends. Try to find out the person's middle name, it could make the search easier. You can also use the French white pages, available in English at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the person's last name in the 'Nom' field and first name in the 'Prenom' field, enter address information if known, and then click 'Trouver' to search. For searching in Paris and its suburbs, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. Posting a missed connection on Paris Craigslist might also be helpful.", "question": "how to find someone in france", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 82.919, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 2701, 5413, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 1447, 16, 13, 5443, 264, 1251, 2711, 3910, 369, 9625, 311, 24523, 28558, 553, 11628, 458, 2551, 476, 6524, 311, 279, 6290, 13994, 304, 279, 3283, 315, 862, 7194, 421, 498, 1414, 1380, 807, 1033, 9223, 382, 17, 13, 9735, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 304, 6364, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 12090, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3725, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 311, 2711, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 382, 18, 13, 19008, 8438, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 320, 17713, 2502, 82181, 701, 279, 8585, 2319, 315, 279, 4158, 6816, 510, 256, 481, 11252, 279, 1537, 829, 304, 279, 36900, 2070, 624, 256, 481, 96195, 11, 3725, 279, 1156, 829, 304, 393, 44843, 624, 256, 481, 5571, 2621, 1995, 304, 279, 68227, 3772, 421, 3881, 26, 5937, 11, 5274, 432, 10113, 311, 2711, 279, 4453, 3146, 624, 256, 481, 9189, 41682, 423, 311, 2711, 369, 279, 829, 13, 576, 3059, 686, 3037, 829, 11, 2621, 11, 323, 4540, 1372, 369, 678, 12579, 25465, 382, 49574, 11, 17004, 264, 13628, 3633, 320, 11604, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732, 285, 520, 956, 48922, 2659, 70416, 49125, 4322, 388, 32574, 1231, 1083, 1492, 382, 16011, 25, 57633, 279, 1697, 594, 6149, 829, 646, 387, 1602, 10950, 311, 5978, 498, 525, 24588, 279, 4396, 3842, 11, 5310], "logp_list": [-0.0096, -0.0001, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.001, -0.0057, -0.0001, -0.315, -0.7464, -0.4339, -0.019, -0.5726, -0.3543, -0.0059, -0.0, -0.0267, -0.0006, -0.0025, -0.0, -0.3942, -0.9122, 