{"id": "438", "pred": "Tip: Knowing the person's middle name can be very helpful to ensure you are identifying the correct individual, especially", "raw_output": "To find someone in France, you can use the following methods as described in the passages:\n\n1. Use a people search website for France to locate relatives by sending an email or letter to the town hall in the city of their birth if you know where they were born.\n\n2. Try the French white pages in English at http://www.pagesjaunes.fr/pb.cgi?lang=en. Instead of typing Paris in the City field, enter IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field to search Paris and its suburbs.\n\n3. Visit www.pagesjaunes.fr (Pages Blanches), the French version of the white pages:\n   - Enter the last name in the Nom field.\n   - Optionally, enter the first name in Prenom.\n   - Input address information in the Ou section if known; otherwise, leave it blank to search the entire country.\n   - Click Trouver to search for the name. The results will display name, address, and phone number for all matching listings.\n\nAdditionally, posting a missed connection (MC) on Paris Craigslist (http://paris.craigslist.org/cgi-bin/pers...) may also help.\n\nTip: Knowing the person's middle name can be very helpful to ensure you are identifying the correct individual, especially", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are the steps to find someone in France:\n\n1. Check the French White Pages (in English): You can use the website pagesjaunes.fr to search for people in France. To search for someone in Paris or its suburbs, enter \"IDF\" (Ile de France) in the department or region field instead of typing Paris.\n2. Use the nom field to enter the last name of the person you are looking for, and you can also include their first name in the prenom field.\n3. Provide address information, if known, in the ou section to refine your search.\n4. Click \"trouver\" to search for the name, and the search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.\n\nNote that the effectiveness of these methods may depend on how up-to-date the information in the white pages is and whether the person you are looking for has listed their contact information publicly.", "question": "how to find someone in france", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 82.532, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 1477, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 498, 646, 990, 279, 2701, 5413, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 46769, 1447, 16, 13, 5443, 264, 1251, 2711, 3910, 369, 9625, 311, 24523, 28558, 553, 11628, 458, 2551, 476, 6524, 311, 279, 6290, 13994, 304, 279, 3283, 315, 862, 7194, 421, 498, 1414, 1380, 807, 1033, 9223, 382, 17, 13, 9735, 279, 8585, 4158, 6816, 304, 6364, 518, 1758, 1110, 2136, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 4322, 65, 59014, 30, 5205, 61757, 13, 12090, 315, 19496, 12095, 304, 279, 4311, 2070, 11, 3725, 71555, 320, 269, 358, 273, 409, 9625, 8, 304, 279, 50221, 9290, 476, 5537, 2070, 311, 2711, 12095, 323, 1181, 46913, 382, 18, 13, 19008, 8438, 37980, 5580, 8531, 18798, 320, 17713, 2502, 82181, 701, 279, 8585, 2319, 315, 279, 4158, 6816, 510, 256, 481, 11252, 279, 1537, 829, 304, 279, 36900, 2070, 624, 256, 481, 96195, 11, 3725, 279, 1156, 829, 304, 393, 44843, 624, 256, 481, 5571, 2621, 1995, 304, 279, 68227, 3772, 421, 3881, 26, 5937, 11, 5274, 432, 10113, 311, 2711, 279, 4453, 3146, 624, 256, 481, 9189, 41682, 423, 311, 2711, 369, 279, 829, 13, 576, 3059, 686, 3037, 829, 11, 2621, 11, 323, 4540, 1372, 369, 678, 12579, 25465, 382, 49574, 11, 17004, 264, 13628, 3633, 320, 11604, 8, 389, 12095, 72292, 320, 1254, 1110, 1732, 285, 520, 956, 48922, 2659, 70416, 49125, 4322, 388, 32574, 1231, 1083, 1492, 382, 16011, 25, 57633, 279, 1697, 594, 6149, 829, 646, 387, 1602, 10950, 311, 5978, 498, 525, 24588, 279, 4396, 3842, 11, 5310], "logp_list": [-0.0096, -0