{"id": "449", "pred": "Based on Passage 3, to file a lien, one copy of the lien entry form and one copy of the lien fee receipt are sent to OTC in the agent's semi-monthly report. Therefore, part of the lien filing process involves including the lien documentation in the semi-monthly report submitted to OTC.", "raw_output": "Based on Passage 3, to file a lien, one copy of the lien entry form and one copy of the lien fee receipt are sent to OTC in the agent's semi-monthly report. Therefore, part of the lien filing process involves including the lien documentation in the semi-monthly report submitted to OTC.", "gt": "Unable to answer based on given passages. The passages provided do not contain information on how to file a lien on a semi. Passage 1 discusses the possibility of a creditor placing a lien on a home that has been transferred to a spouse, while passage 2 explains the general process for placing a lien on business property but does not mention semis specifically. Passage 3 describes the documentation and distribution of copies of a lien entry form, but does not provide instructions on how to file a lien. Therefore, without additional information, it is impossible to provide an answer to the question.", "question": "how do i file a lien on a semi", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 23.398, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 98475, 220, 18, 11, 311, 1034, 264, 54420, 11, 825, 2975, 315, 279, 54420, 4343, 1352, 323, 825, 2975, 315, 279, 54420, 11060, 22567, 525, 3208, 311, 506, 7749, 304, 279, 8315, 594, 18267, 22289, 398, 1895, 13, 15277, 11, 949, 315, 279, 54420, 25480, 1882, 17601, 2670, 279, 54420, 9705, 304, 279, 18267, 22289, 398, 1895, 14634, 311, 506, 7749, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0883, -0.0, -0.2527, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.007, -0.2266, -0.005, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.6564, -0.7549, -0.0012, -0.0018, -0.0, -0