{"id": "461", "pred": "Eliminates toxins, improves circulation, provides pain relief, and offers mental health benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression.", "raw_output": "The benefits of cupping massage include:\n\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping.\n\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\n\nAnswer: Eliminates toxins, improves circulation, provides pain relief, and offers mental health benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression.", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits. It is known to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve blood circulation. It also aids in pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation, which subsequently improves flexibility and increases range of motion. Additionally, cupping massage has mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 46.089, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 374, 9251, 382, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 382, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 1096, 646, 1492, 5263, 2088, 315, 11379, 11, 7269, 24177, 11, 323,