{"id": "464", "pred": "Eliminates toxins, improves circulation, provides pain relief, and offers mental health benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression.", "raw_output": "The benefits of cupping massage include:\n\n1. Eliminates toxins: A cupping massage is an effective way to get rid of toxins from the body. When a vacuum is created in the cup, a negative pressure is applied.\n\n2. Improved circulation: Increased blood circulation can be brought about by cupping.\n\n3. Pain relief: A cupping massage helps reduce inflammation of tissues. This can help increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain.\n\n4. Mental benefits: A cupping massage has therapeutic benefits like decreasing anxiety and depression.\n\nAnswer: Eliminates toxins, improves circulation, provides pain relief, and offers mental health benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression.", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of cupping massage:\n\n* Eliminates toxins\n* Improves circulation\n* Provides pain relief\n* Reduces inflammation\n* Has therapeutic benefits such as reducing anxiety and depression\n\nAccording to the passages, cupping massage can help remove toxins from the body, increase blood flow, relieve pain, and have a positive impact on mental well-being.", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 45.811, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 7567, 315, 10525, 9989, 6245, 2924, 1447, 16, 13, 42320, 258, 973, 61086, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 374, 458, 7373, 1616, 311, 633, 9279, 315, 61086, 504, 279, 2487, 13, 3197, 264, 28202, 374, 3465, 304, 279, 10525, 11, 264, 8225, 7262, 374, 9251, 382, 17, 13, 58123, 34755, 25, 61597, 6543, 34755, 646, 387, 7117, 911, 553, 10525, 9989, 382, 18, 13, 34467, 15957, 25, 362, 10525, 9989, 6245, 8609, 7949, 36040, 315, 38781, 13, 109