{"id": "481", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts for this reason, and if you received warnings (three or more times) and changed your password without regaining access, it indicates your account was locked due to third-party app usage. Snapchat takes this action to protect user security, as third-party apps can put your and your friends' data at risk. Some users have also received official emails from Snapchat warning them about third-party apps before being locked out.", "raw_output": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts for this reason, and if you received warnings (three or more times) and changed your password without regaining access, it indicates your account was locked due to third-party app usage. Snapchat takes this action to protect user security, as third-party apps can put your and your friends' data at risk. Some users have also received official emails from Snapchat warning them about third-party apps before being locked out.", "gt": "Your Snapchat account may be temporarily locked if you have used third-party apps to access Snapchat. The company does not guarantee your security when using these apps and may send you a warning message before locking your account. If you have been warned multiple times and continue using third-party apps, your account may remain locked.", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 36.509, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [7771, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 264, 4843, 24031, 3766, 311, 2615, 432, 13, 55179, 48040, 3847, 5248, 3039, 1573, 37855, 9618, 369, 419, 2874, 