{"id": "482", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts for this reason, and if you received warnings (three or more times) and changed your password without regaining access, it indicates your account was locked due to third-party app usage. Snapchat takes this action to protect user security, as third-party apps can put your and your friends' data at risk. Some users have also received official emails from Snapchat warning them about third-party apps before being locked out.", "raw_output": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts for this reason, and if you received warnings (three or more times) and changed your password without regaining access, it indicates your account was locked due to third-party app usage. Snapchat takes this action to protect user security, as third-party apps can put your and your friends' data at risk. Some users have also received official emails from Snapchat warning them about third-party apps before being locked out.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, Snapchat may temporarily lock an account if the user has been using third-party applications to access the app. These third-party apps can compromise the security of the account and put the user and their friends at risk. Snapchat may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the user continues to use third-party apps, their account may be locked.", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 36.528, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [7771, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 264, 4843, 24031, 3766, 311, 2615, 432, 13, 55179, 48040,