{"id": "485", "pred": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts for this reason, and if you received warnings (three or more times) and changed your password without regaining access, it indicates your account was locked due to third-party app usage. Snapchat takes this action to protect user security, as third-party apps can put your and your friends' data at risk. Some users have also received official emails from Snapchat warning them about third-party apps before being locked out.", "raw_output": "Your Snapchat account is temporarily locked because you used a third-party application to access it. Snapchat warns users multiple times before locking accounts for this reason, and if you received warnings (three or more times) and changed your password without regaining access, it indicates your account was locked due to third-party app usage. Snapchat takes this action to protect user security, as third-party apps can put your and your friends' data at risk. Some users have also received official emails from Snapchat warning them about third-party apps before being locked out.", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, it appears that your Snapchat account has been temporarily locked due to using third-party apps. According to passage 2, Snapchat does not guarantee security when using third-party apps, and they may lock your account if they detect such usage. Passage 3 also mentions that Snapchat has taken steps to punish individuals who use third-party apps, which could result in account lockout.\n\nIt's possible that you have been warned multiple times by Snapchat about using third-party apps, as mentioned in passage 1, and your account has been locked as a result. To regain access to your account, you may need to stop using third-party apps and wait for an official Snapchat app to become available for your device, as suggested in passage 2.", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 36.45, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [7771, 55179, 2692, 374, 27092, 16061, 1576, 498, 1483, 264, 4843, 24031, 3766, 311, 2615, 432, 13, 55179, 48040, 3847, 5248, 3039, 1573, 37855, 9618, 369, 419, 2874, 11, 323, 421, 498, 3949, 18993, 320, 27856, 476, 803, 3039, 8, 323, 5497, 697, 3552, 2041, 1217, 2056, 2615, 11, 432, 14807, 697, 2692, 572, 16061, 4152, 311, 4843, 24031, 906, 10431, 13, 55179, 4990, 419, 1917, 311, 6016, 1196, 4763, 11, 438, 4843, 24031, 10500, 646, 2182, 697, 323, 697, 4780, 6, 821, 518, 5214, 13, 4329, 3847, 614, 1083, 3949, 3946, 14298, 504, 55179, 9958, 1105, 911, 4843, 24031, 10500, 1573, 1660, 16061, 700, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0575, -0.0, -0.0045, -0.591, -0.1646, -0.0001, -0.0898, -0.0722, -0.1294, -0.4741, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0789, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0701, -0.0032, -0.0002, -0.0043, -0.0001, -0.2815, 0.0, -0.3267, -0.0091, -0.4993, -0.3903, -0.2655, -0.016, -0.2848, -0.0094, -0.8461, -0.2597, -0.9431, -0.4352, -0.1867, -0.9871, -0.0068, -0.3869, -0.0831, -0.4903, -0.1611, -1.1207, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.4951, -0.7643, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0135, -0.5904, -1.2278, -0.9705, -0.0001, -0.9605, -0.0635, -0.4101, -0.0, -0.1677, -0.0, -0.0024, -0.0089, -0.0002, -0.626, -0.9748, -0.1838, -1.1232, -0.0934, -0.1621, -0.0728, -0.0016, -0.1341, -0.3991, -1.0743, -0.0001, -0.0018, -1.1106, -0.5747, -1.3592, -0.5063, -0.0055, -0.0068, -0.2812, -0.4866, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0456, -0.5126, -0.0015, -0.1166, -0.5057, -0.1353, -0.494, -0.7341, -0.0911, -0.0, -0.3935, -0.2522, -0.2432, -0.1458, -0.0006, -0.3034, -0.1456, -0.0403, -0.0004, -0.0046, -0.0012, -0.036], "cumulative_logprob": -28.7862, "norm_logp": -0.269, "input_len": 559, "output_tokens": 107, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 38.32, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.7, "Status": "success", "GAV