{"id": "542", "pred": "People born in October may be success-oriented and charming (October 1), restless yet craving stability (October 5), or have a keen eye for form and structure (October 14).", "raw_output": "Based on the provided passages, people born in October exhibit a variety of traits:\n\n- Those born on **October 1** are success-oriented, charming, personally powerful, and perform best when in control or as their own boss. They have good \"people skills\" but can occasionally show impatience.\n- Those born on **October 5** are restless at heart but crave stability and security, which motivates them to work hard at whatever they do.\n- Those born on **October 14** have a great interest in form and structure, making them well-suited for careers in architecture, interior decoration, design, or any field combining art and structure.\n\nFamous individuals born on various October dates include Charlton Heston, Jackie Collins, Anne Rice, Susan Sarandon, Alicia Silverstone, Rachael Leigh Cook, and Buster Keaton.\n\nAnswer: People born in October may be success-oriented and charming (October 1), restless yet craving stability (October 5), or have a keen eye for form and structure (October 14).", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset