{"id": "571", "pred": "To do the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you can use specific button combinations. For example, the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. These button combinations work for both Xbox 360 and Xbox One consoles, as well as on PC with a controller. Additionally, video guides that demonstrate what each Skill Move looks like are available at the top of the relevant page for visual assistance.", "raw_output": "To do the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you can use specific button combinations. For example, the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. These button combinations work for both Xbox 360 and Xbox One consoles, as well as on PC with a controller. Additionally, video guides that demonstrate what each Skill Move looks like are available at the top of the relevant page for visual assistance.", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here is how to perform skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Press and hold the LT button on the Xbox controller, followed by a quick tap of the RB button.\n\nThat's it! This combination will allow you to perform the ball juggling skill move while standing on the field in FIFA 16 on Xbox One.", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 32.175, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 653, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 646, 990, 3151, 3137, 27459, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 12836, 619, 49328, 320, 3472, 11259, 8, 9947, 3271, 374, 15695, 553, 9963, 34469, 323, 52628, 27974, 13, 4220, 3137, 27459, 975, 369, 2176, 20577, 220, 18, 21, 15, 323, 20577, 3776, 50093, 11, 438, 1632, 438, 389, 6673, 448, 264, 6461, 13, 22406, 11, 2766, 27193, 429, 19869, 1128, 1817, 274