{"id": "572", "pred": "To do the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you can use specific button combinations. For example, the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. These button combinations work for both Xbox 360 and Xbox One consoles, as well as on PC with a controller. Additionally, video guides that demonstrate what each Skill Move looks like are available at the top of the relevant page for visual assistance.", "raw_output": "To do the skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One, you can use specific button combinations. For example, the Ball Juggle (while standing) skill move is executed by holding LT and tapping RB. These button combinations work for both Xbox 360 and Xbox One consoles, as well as on PC with a controller. Additionally, video guides that demonstrate what each Skill Move looks like are available at the top of the relevant page for visual assistance.", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Based on the given passages, here's how to do skill moves on FIFA 16 for Xbox One:\n\n1. Ball Juggle (while standing): Hold LT + tap RB.\n\nNote that this combination works for Xbox 360 and Xbox One controllers. If you're playing on PC with a controller, the buttons may be different. Additionally, there are tutorial videos available online that show what each skill move looks like, which can be helpful in mastering these moves.", "question": "how to do the skill moves on fifa 16 for xbox one", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 32.287, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 653, 279, 9947, 10797, 389, 43642, 220, 16, 21, 369, 20577, 3776, 11, 498, 646, 990, 3151, 3137, 27459, 13, 1752, 3110, 11, 279, 12836, 619, 49328, 320, 3472, 11259, 8, 9947, 3271, 374, 15695, 553, 9963, 34469, 323, 52628, 27974, 13, 4220, 3137, 27459, 975, 369, 2176, 20577, 220, 18, 21, 15, 323, 20577, 3776, 50093,