{"id": "573", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home. Eliminate any sources of food and shelter, as mice will take advantage of these. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents using steel wool pads to prevent mice from using these holes to re-enter your home. This adds an extra layer of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Promptly addressing these entry points and removing attractants will help eliminate mice and prevent their return.", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home. Eliminate any sources of food and shelter, as mice will take advantage of these. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents using steel wool pads to prevent mice from using these holes to re-enter your home. This adds an extra layer of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Promptly addressing these entry points and removing attractants will help eliminate mice and prevent their return.", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you need to take immediate action. You can start by identifying all possible entry points that mice use to get into your house. Once identified, consider putting steel wool inside these holes or vents before sealing them off. This will prevent the mice from using these paths to re-enter your home. By doing so, you eliminate their access to food or shelter in your house, which can help in getting rid of them quickly.", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 34.781, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 1896, 13922, 1917, 438, 807, 646, 18512, 1896, 705, 21682, 323, 1191, 66710, 304, 697, 2114, 13, 42320, 3277, 894, 8173, 315, 3607, 323, 22906, 11, 438, 