{"id": "574", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home. Eliminate any sources of food and shelter, as mice will take advantage of these. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents using steel wool pads to prevent mice from using these holes to re-enter your home. This adds an extra layer of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Promptly addressing these entry points and removing attractants will help eliminate mice and prevent their return.", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home. Eliminate any sources of food and shelter, as mice will take advantage of these. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents using steel wool pads to prevent mice from using these holes to re-enter your home. This adds an extra layer of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Promptly addressing these entry points and removing attractants will help eliminate mice and prevent their return.", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 34.654, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 1896, 13922, 1917, 438, 807, 646, 18512, 1896, 705, 21682, 323, 1191, 66710, 304, 697, 2114, 13, 42320, 3277, 894, 8173, 315, 3607, 323, 22906, 11, 438, 23627, 686, 1896, 9423, 315,