{"id": "575", "pred": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home. Eliminate any sources of food and shelter, as mice will take advantage of these. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents using steel wool pads to prevent mice from using these holes to re-enter your home. This adds an extra layer of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Promptly addressing these entry points and removing attractants will help eliminate mice and prevent their return.", "raw_output": "To quickly get rid of mice, take immediate action as they can rapidly take up residence and start nesting in your home. Eliminate any sources of food and shelter, as mice will take advantage of these. Seal off entry points such as pipes or vents using steel wool pads to prevent mice from using these holes to re-enter your home. This adds an extra layer of protection, especially if the mice are persistent. Promptly addressing these entry points and removing attractants will help eliminate mice and prevent their return.", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, you should take immediate action by sealing off entry points that mice could use to enter your home. Steel wool is a good material to use for this purpose as it will prevent mice from using the hole to get back into your house. Additionally, getting rid of rats and mice involves eliminating any sources of food and shelter for these rodents and preventing them from returning.", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 34.787, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 11, 1896, 13922, 1917, 438, 807, 646, 18512, 1896, 705, 21682, 323, 1191, 66710, 304, 697, 2114, 13, 42320, 3277, 894, 8173, 315, 3607, 323, 22906, 11, 438, 23627, 686, 1896, 9423, 315, 1493, 13, 525