{"id": "604", "pred": "Cycling is a type of aerobic exercise that may be better than other forms of aerobic exercise for individuals with arthritic or orthopedic problems due to its low-impact nature.", "raw_output": "Based on the provided passages, cycling is a type of aerobic exercise. Passage 2 highlights that cycling has wide appeal and value and may be ideal for individuals with orthopedic issues like arthritis who cannot walk for long periods. Passage 3 notes that the stationary bike provides the lowest impact workout compared to equipment like treadmills and rowing machines because it supports most of the user's weight.\n\nSince cycling is a form of aerobic exercise and offers specific benefits such as low impact and suitability for people with joint problems, it can be considered a particularly beneficial aerobic activity for certain individuals. However, the passages do not compare all forms of aerobic exercise in general, nor do they state that cycling is universally better than all other aerobic exercises.\n\nTherefore, the answer depends on individual needs and conditions. For people with joint issues, cycling may be better than other aerobic exercises like running or walking. For others, different aerobic activities may be more suitable.\n\nAnswer: Cycling is a type of aerobic exercise that may be better than other forms of aerobic exercise for individuals with arthritic or orthopedic problems due to its low-impact nature.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that both cycling and aerobic exercise have their benefits, but there are some differences to consider.\n\nPassage 2 suggests that cycling may be more suitable for individuals with arthritic or orthopedic problems due to its low-impact nature. Additionally, passage 3 states that stationary cycling provides the lowest impact workout compared to other indoor exercises like the treadmill and rowing machine.\n\nHowever, it's important to note that aerobic exercise, such as running, can also be beneficial for overall health and fitness. Passage 1 encourages individuals to view a wide variety of physical activities as challenges and find their fitness Zen, suggesting that different types of exercise may be better suited to different people depending on their goals and preferences.\n\nTherefore, I cannot definitively say which is better, cycling or aerobic exercise, based on the given passages. Both types of exercise have their advantages and disadvantages, and the best choice will depend on the individual's specific needs and goals.", "question": "which is better exercise cycling or aerobic", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 72.879, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 3897, 46769, 11, 32062, 374, 264, 943, 315, 90390, 10158, 13, 98475, 220, 17, 21314, 429, 32062, 702, 6884, 14303, 323, 897, 323, 1231, 387, 10507, 369, 7775, 448, 29199, 16367, 292, 4714, 1075, 54552, 879, 4157, 4227, 369, 1293, 18346, 13, 98475, 220, 18, 8388, 429, 279, 52635, 12963, 5707, 279, 15457, 5421, 25242, 7707, 311, 7096, 1075, 47714, 76, 3305, 323, 2802, 287, 12645, 1576, 432, 11554, 1429, 315, 279, 1196, 594, 4680, 382, 12549, 32062, 374, 264, 1352, 315, 90390, 10158, 323, 6081, 3151, 7567, 1741, 438, 3347, 5421, 323, 80628, 369, 1251, 448, 10284, 5322, 11, 432, 646, 387, 6509, 264, 7945, 23699, 90390, 5702, 369, 3654, 7775, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 46769, 653, 537, 9429, 678, 7586, 315, 90390, 10158, 304, 4586, 11, 6329, 653, 807, 1584, 429, 32062, 374, 60428, 2664, 1091, 678, 1008, 90390, 22932, 382, 54815, 11, 279, 4226, 13798, 389, 3842, 3880, 323, 4682, 13, 1752, 1251, 448, 10284, 4714, 11, 32062, 1231, 387, 2664, 1091, 1008, 90390, 22932, 1075, 4303, 476, 11435, 13, 1752, 3800, 11, 2155, 90390, 7488, 1231, 387, 803, 14452, 382, 16141, 25, 59970, 374, 264, 943, 315, 90390, 10158, 429, 1231, 387, 2664, 1091, 1008, 7586, 315, 9