{"id": "630", "pred": "To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, maintain a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend effectively.", "raw_output": "To guard a tall person in basketball, stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to minimize shot opportunities. Additionally, maintain a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend effectively.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here is how to guard a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to the tall, skilled shooter when guarding them near the three-point line.\n2. Actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities.\n3. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player.\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is essential to stay close to them, move quickly laterally to maintain position, and use a defensive strategy such as keeping a wedge between the basket and the offensive player.", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 20.037, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 11, 4717, 438, 3265, 438, 3204, 311, 264, 16217, 11, 25530, 31571, 3143, 279, 2326, 16574, 1555, 323, 22040, 14983, 697, 7541, 504, 3108, 311, 3108, 311, 29337, 6552, 10488, 13, 22406, 11, 10306, 264, 63685, 1948, 279, 14024, 323, 279, 15183, 2781, 311, 10505, 13444, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.4529, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1671, -0.0, -0.0, -0.184, -0.0111, -0.0381, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.004, -0.3572, -0.0111, -0.0002, -0.0, 