{"id": "637", "pred": "Jalapeño health benefits include pain-killing properties, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, helping prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeño peppers support cardiovascular health by defending heart health and increasing cardiovascular benefits. These benefits are largely attributed to their capsaicin content, which determines their heat level.", "raw_output": "Jalapeño health benefits include pain-killing properties, serving as a spicy weight loss alternative, acting as a natural nasal decongestant, helping prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and even cancer, and being full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. Additionally, jalapeño peppers support cardiovascular health by defending heart health and increasing cardiovascular benefits. These benefits are largely attributed to their capsaicin content, which determines their heat level.", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 31.411, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [41, 278, 2027, 14529, 2820, 7567, 2924, 6646, 12646, 9400, 5888, 11, 13480, 438, 264, 47251, 4680, 4709, 10555, 11, 15358, 438, 264, 5810, 71088, 409, 443, 6969, 517, 11, 10476, 5358, 4746, 8457, 11, 4746, 8776, 11, 323, 1496, 9387, 11, 323, 1660, 2480, 315, 45092, 11, 32972, 11, 323, 80015, 13, 22406, 11, 7