{"id": "657", "pred": "Following these steps ensures your hair is cleaned gently and effectively without causing damage.", "raw_output": "To properly clean your hair, follow these steps:\n\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. While in the shower, ensure the water is warm (not too hot) and turn the flow down slightly.\n3. Thoroughly wet the hair.\n4. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through the hair. If your hair is longer, comb through it with fingers instead of piling it on your head to reduce tangles.\n5. Rinse the hair completely.\n6. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and let it remain on for a few minutes.\n7. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again to smooth.\n8. Dry the hair by wrapping it gently with a towel or patting/stroking it—never rub back and forth or in circles, as wet hair is weak and rubbing can cause damage.\n9. Optionally, use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.\n\nFollowing these steps ensures your hair is cleaned gently and effectively without causing damage.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a step-by-step guide on how to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Wet your hair thoroughly.\n3. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through your hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles if your hair is longer.\n4. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n5. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n6. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n7. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing it back and forth or in circles.\n8. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.\n\nTherefore, the steps to properly clean your hair are:\n\n1. Choose the right products.\n2. Wet your hair.\n3. Shampoo your hair.\n4. Rinse and detangle.\n5. Condition your hair.\n6. Rinse and comb.\n7. Dry your hair with a towel.\n8. Use a hair dryer.", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 70.665, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [1249, 10277, 4240, 697, 6869, 11, 1795, 1493, 7354, 1447, 16, 13, 8427, 279, 6169, 61932, 323, 64324, 369, 697, 6869, 943, 624, 17, 13, 5976, 304, 279, 17196, 11, 5978, 279, 3015, 374, 8205, 320, 1921, 2238, 4017, 8, 323, 2484, 279, 6396, 1495, 10078, 624, 18, 13, 663, 14438, 398, 14401, 279, 6869, 624, 19, 13, 20552, 264, 51249, 27835, 3311, 315, 61932, 1119, 279, 32452, 315, 697, 1424, 323, 975, 432, 1526, 279, 6869, 13, 1416, 697, 6869, 374, 5021, 11, 3614, 1526, 432, 448, 19225, 4518, 315, 281, 7979, 432, 389, 697, 1968, 311, 7949, 259, 17248, 624, 20, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 6587, 624, 21, 13, 20552, 64324, 304, 279, 1852, 11566, 438, 279, 61932, 323, 1077, 432, 7146, 389, 369, 264, 2421, 4420, 624, 22, 13, 57368, 325, 279, 6869, 448, 7010, 3015, 323, 3614, 1526, 432, 1549, 311, 10876, 624, 23, 13, 30841, 279, 6869, 553, 41195, 432, 29273, 448, 264, 42613, 476, 3272, 1280, 14272, 299, 10566, 432, 2293, 36493, 10273, 1182, 323, 13241, 476, 304, 25362, 11, 438, 14401, 6869, 374, 7469, 323, 55935, 646, 5240, 5557, 624, 24, 13, 96195, 11, 990, 264, 6869, 46622, 311, 6587, 9058, 697, 6869, 382, 26957, 1493, 7354, 25351, 697, 6869, 374, 27722, 29273, 323, 13444, 2041, 14381, 5557, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0361, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0001, 0.0, -0.0184, -0.0221, -0.0003, -0.0005, -0.1691, -0.0008, -0.0006, -0.083, -0.1743, -0.2836, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1908, -0.0, -0.0142, 0.0, -0.014, -0.0, 0.0, -0.8571, -0.0012, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.2348, -0.0807, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.6136, -0.3869, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0394, -0.0002, -0.4798, -0.1614,