{"id": "659", "pred": "- Final rinse for a shiny, healthy coat: Mix 1 cup of vinegar with 2–4 cups of water and use as a final rinse.\n- Normalize skin pH balance: Spray vinegar full-strength on the dog’s coat.\n- Improve skin and coat: Use apple cider vinegar (ACV) as a rinse.\n- Clean dog’s ears: Dilute apple cider vinegar with 50% water and apply with a cotton swab or gauze pad to soothe itchy ears.\n- Repel fleas: Spray ACV directly on the dog’s coat.\n- Bath in ACV-soap mixture to fight fleas.\n- Rinse the dog after treatment.", "raw_output": "- Final rinse for a shiny, healthy coat: Mix 1 cup of vinegar with 2–4 cups of water and use as a final rinse.\n- Normalize skin pH balance: Spray vinegar full-strength on the dog’s coat.\n- Improve skin and coat: Use apple cider vinegar (ACV) as a rinse.\n- Clean dog’s ears: Dilute apple cider vinegar with 50% water and apply with a cotton swab or gauze pad to soothe itchy ears.\n- Repel fleas: Spray ACV directly on the dog’s coat.\n- Bath in ACV-soap mixture to fight fleas.\n- Rinse the dog after treatment.", "gt": "Vinegar can be used to improve a dog's skin and coat, clean out their ears, repel fleas, and soothe itchy ears.", "question": "vinegar uses for dogs", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 46.907, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [12, 13023, 73241, 369, 264, 41199, 11, 9314, 22875, 25, 19219, 220, 16, 10525, 315, 46105, 448, 220, 17, 4142, 19, 25374, 315, 3015, 323, 990, 438, 264, 1590, 73241, 624, 12, 68092, 6787, 36043, 8172, 25, 60561, 46105, 2480, 5477, 17842, 389, 279, 5562, 748, 22875, 624, 12, 64084, 6787, 323, 22875, 25, 5443, 23268, 65055, 46105, 320, 1706, 53, 8, 438, 264, 73241, 624, 12, 9590, 5562, 748, 24230, 25, 52767, 1070, 23268, 65055, 46105, 448, 220, 20, 15, 4, 3015, 323, 3796, 448, 264, 23522, 2021, 370, 476, 342, 2863, 2986, 11016, 311, 43176, 1782, 432, 