{"id": "677", "pred": "Benefits of drinking clove tea include stress relief, pain relief (especially for muscle, joint, and arthritic pain), soothing abdominal and gas pain, aiding digestion, and providing skin benefits. The passages do not mention any side effects.", "raw_output": "Benefits of drinking clove tea:\n\n1. Stress Relief: Mixing cloves with basil, mint, and cardamom in water to make flavored tea, and consuming it with honey, helps soothe the senses and relieve stress.\n\n2. Pain Relief: Clove tea compresses are effective for relieving pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. Cold tea compresses are recommended when there is significant swelling, while warm tea works better for arthritic pain.\n\n3. Digestive Aid: Clove tea has analgesic qualities that soothe abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. It stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid digestion.\n\n4. Skin Benefits: Besides health benefits, clove tea also offers amazing skin benefits (though specific details are not provided in the passages).\n\nSide Effects:\n\nThe provided passages do not mention any side effects of drinking clove tea. Therefore, based on the given information, no side effects can be identified.\n\nAnswer: Benefits of drinking clove tea include stress relief, pain relief (especially for muscle, joint, and arthritic pain), soothing abdominal and gas pain, aiding digestion, and providing skin benefits. The passages do not mention any side effects.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from abdominal pain and aiding digestion. The side effects of drinking clove tea are not mentioned in the given passages.", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 80.937, "status": "suc