{"id": "679", "pred": "Benefits of drinking clove tea include stress relief, pain relief (especially for muscle, joint, and arthritic pain), soothing abdominal and gas pain, aiding digestion, and providing skin benefits. The passages do not mention any side effects.", "raw_output": "Benefits of drinking clove tea:\n\n1. Stress Relief: Mixing cloves with basil, mint, and cardamom in water to make flavored tea, and consuming it with honey, helps soothe the senses and relieve stress.\n\n2. Pain Relief: Clove tea compresses are effective for relieving pain from muscle, joint, or ligament injuries. Cold tea compresses are recommended when there is significant swelling, while warm tea works better for arthritic pain.\n\n3. Digestive Aid: Clove tea has analgesic qualities that soothe abdominal pain, gas pain, and other stomach upsets. It stimulates blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions to aid digestion.\n\n4. Skin Benefits: Besides health benefits, clove tea also offers amazing skin benefits (though specific details are not provided in the passages).\n\nSide Effects:\n\nThe provided passages do not mention any side effects of drinking clove tea. Therefore, based on the given information, no side effects can be identified.\n\nAnswer: Benefits of drinking clove tea include stress relief, pain relief (especially for muscle, joint, and arthritic pain), soothing abdominal and gas pain, aiding digestion, and providing skin benefits. The passages do not mention any side effects.", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea:\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Soothes the senses and relieves stress (Passage 1)\n* Provides relief from pain due to muscle, joint, or ligament injuries (Passage 2)\n* Soothes abdominal pain and aids in digestion (Passage 3)\n\nSide Effects:\n\n* None mentioned in the passages.\n\nNote that there are no side effects mentioned in the passages provided. However, it's important to note that consuming clove tea in large quantities can cause irritation to the stomach and digestive tract, so it's best to consume it in moderation.", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 80.73, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [84323, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 1447, 16, 13, 50468, 52395, 25, 96599, 84288, 448, 67086, 11, 28337, 11, 323, 3701, 309, 316, 304, 3015, 311, 1281, 87240, 15243, 11, 323, 34108, 432, 448, 25744, 11, 8609, 43176, 1782, 279, 37107, 323, 47739, 8464, 382, 17, 13, 34467, 52395, 25, 18679, 586, 15243, 24611, 288, 525, 7373, 369, 58544, 4405, 6646, 504, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 476, 28313, 2838, 14970, 13, 23185, 15243, 24611, 288, 525, 11102, 979, 1052, 374, 5089, 54207, 11, 1393, 8205, 15243, 4278, 2664, 369, 796, 339, 49208, 6646, 382, 18, 13, 53289, 533, 37405, 25, 18679, 586, 15243, 702, 3181, 4188, 292, 28500, 429, 43176, 1782, 55956, 6646, 11, 6819, 6646, 11, 323, 1008, 22350, 705, 4917, 13, 1084, 94355, 6543, 6396, 11, 84557, 5670, 11, 323, 88285, 6234, 908, 311, 12296, 73402, 382, 19, 13, 26951, 38095, 25, 30809, 2820, 7567, 11, 5292, 586, 15243, 1083, 6081, 7897, 6787, 7567, 320, 4535, 3151, 3565, 525, 537, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 3593, 16384, 29146, 1447, 785, 3897, 46769, 653, 537, 6286, 894, 3108, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 13, 15277, 11, 3118, 389, 279, 2661, 1995, 11, 902, 3108, 6239, 646, 387, 10820, 382, 16141, 25, 38095, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 2924, 8464, 15957, 11, 6646, 15957, 320, 34946, 369, 15747, 11, 10284, 11, 323, 796, 339, 49208, 6646, 701, 64364, 55956, 323, 6819, 6646, 11, 85287, 73402, 11, 323, 8241, 6787, 7567, 13, 576, 46769, 653, 537, 6286, 894, 3108, 6239, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.0078, -0.1522, -0.0381, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0, -0.1984, -0.1605, -0.0, -0.5256, -0.079, -0.0297, -0.0645, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0101, 0.0, -0.0, -