{"id": "715", "pred": "Pushups, dumbbell bench presses, and dumbbell flyes (as described in Passage 3) are exercises that tone the chest.", "raw_output": "Based on the passage, the Anarchy Workout includes specific exercises to tone and build the chest. The first workout features a modified tri-set for the chest designed to pump the pecs and stretch connective tissue to allow muscle growth. The second chest-focused exercise pairs pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. Additionally, Passage 3 describes a dumbbell exercise where you lie on your back, extend arms out to form a cross, curl hands together until dumbbells meet above the chest, and slowly return arms to sides—this is a form of dumbbell fly or chest fly movement that targets the pectoral muscles.\n\nAnswer: Pushups, dumbbell bench presses, and dumbbell flyes (as described in Passage 3) are exercises that tone the chest.", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 52.577, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 21085, 11, 279, 1527, 15272, 69142, 5646, 3151, 22932, 311, 16232, 323, 1936, 279, 15138, 13, 576, 1156, 25242, 4419, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 6188, 311, 13834, 279, 30000, 82, 323, 14501, 4564, 533, 19847, 311, 2138, 15747, 6513, 13, 576, 2086, 15138, 51273, 10158, 13530, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 22406, 11, 98475, 220, 18, 16555, 264, 29255, 17250, 10158, 1380, 498, 10246, 389, 697, 1182, 11,