{"id": "716", "pred": "Pushups, dumbbell bench presses, and dumbbell flyes (as described in Passage 3) are exercises that tone the chest.", "raw_output": "Based on the passage, the Anarchy Workout includes specific exercises to tone and build the chest. The first workout features a modified tri-set for the chest designed to pump the pecs and stretch connective tissue to allow muscle growth. The second chest-focused exercise pairs pushups with very heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses. Additionally, Passage 3 describes a dumbbell exercise where you lie on your back, extend arms out to form a cross, curl hands together until dumbbells meet above the chest, and slowly return arms to sides—this is a form of dumbbell fly or chest fly movement that targets the pectoral muscles.\n\nAnswer: Pushups, dumbbell bench presses, and dumbbell flyes (as described in Passage 3) are exercises that tone the chest.", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, the following exercises are mentioned as toning the chest:\n\n* Modified tri-set for the chest (not specified)\n* Pushups\n* Dumbbell bench presses\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What exercises tone the chest?\" based on the given passages is:\n\nModified tri-set for the chest, pushups, and dumbbell bench presses.", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 52.375, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 21085, 11, 279, 1527, 15272, 69142, 5646, 3151, 22932, 311, 16232, 323, 1936, 279, 15138, 13, 576, 1156, 25242, 4419, 264, 10807, 2406, 24096, 369, 279, 15138, 6188, 311, 13834, 279, 30000, 82, 323, 14501, 4564, 533, 19847, 311, 2138, 15747, 6513, 13, 576, 2086, 15138, 51273, 10158, 13530, 4484, 8602, 448, 1602, 8811, 7289, 315, 29255, 17250, 13425, 52963, 13, 22406, 11, 98475, 220, 18, 16555, 264, 29255, 17250, 10158, 1380, 498, 10246,