{"id": "736", "pred": "The difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS (Short Message Service) only allows you to send text messages with a maximum of 160 characters per message, and longer messages are split into parts. In contrast, MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) is an evolution of SMS that allows you to send multimedia content such as pictures, videos, audio, and text, either individually or in combination. MMS messages can carry larger content sizes, up to 300KB, and support formats like WAV, JPEG, and GIF.", "raw_output": "The difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS (Short Message Service) only allows you to send text messages with a maximum of 160 characters per message, and longer messages are split into parts. In contrast, MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) is an evolution of SMS that allows you to send multimedia content such as pictures, videos, audio, and text, either individually or in combination. MMS messages can carry larger content sizes, up to 300KB, and support formats like WAV, JPEG, and GIF.", "gt": "The difference between SMS and MMS is that SMS allows you to send text-only messages of up to 160 characters, while MMS allows you to send messages with pictures, sounds, videos, and text, with a larger content size of up to 300KB.", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "cad", "has_cad": true, "cad_context": "passage", "time_sec": 37.595, "status": "success", "record_process": true, "token_ids": [785, 6672, 1948, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 374, 429, 29909, 320, 12472, 4856, 5362, 8, 1172, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 1467, 6605, 448, 264, 7192, 315, 220, 16, 21, 15, 5766, 817, 1943, 11, 323, 5021, 6605, 525, 6718, 1119, 5479, 13, 758, 12872, 11, 386, 4826, 320, 40404, 26936, 73170, 5362, 8, 374, 458, 15379, 315, 29909, 429, 6147, 498, 311, 3624, 56513, 2213, 1741, 438, 9185, 11, 6803, 11, 7699, 11, 323, 1467, 11, 2987, 31299, 476, 304, 10601, 13, 386,